--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Covers: base32, base64, basename, cat, cksum (shared checksum machinery),
b2sum, md5sum, sha1sum, sha224sum, sha256sum, sha384sum, sha512sum, comm, cp,
cut, date, dirname, head, hostname, ln, ls, mkdir, mktemp, mv, nl, nproc,
paste, printenv, readlink, realpath, rm, seq, sort, stat, tac, tail, tee,
touch, tr, truncate, uname, uniq, wc, whoami, yes.

